c 39420 Routines run when a statement of the case is proven
D 39420 Short routines whose addresses appear in the records between the player's plan script (which ends at #R$994A($994C) - CORRECTED, it was once taken for a five-entry table at #R$9923($9927)) and here (#R$99A9($99AD) -> #R$99FC, #R$99E3($99E7) -> #R$9A05, #R$9997($999B) -> #R$9A13, #R$9965($9969) -> #R$9A3D, #R$9973($9977) -> #R$9A4B, #R$9981($9985) -> #R$9A59). Each marks the current record done (#R$9A74: IX+3 bit 1 set, bit 0 clear), sometimes sets a flag in another record, and prints a message. UPDATED 2026-11-07: the records are the case table at #R$9965 (statements and their evidence); each of these routines belongs to one statement.
D 39420 CORRECTED: the automatic split had these as data ('b' and 't' blocks); found because message references were landing inside data (tools/check.py). Read from code, not traced.
D 39420 Instruction coverage over the 15 stored routes (9 November, tools/experiments/insn_coverage.py): 41 of 45 instructions executed; #R$9A2F #R$9A33 #R$9A37 #R$9A3A never ran there and are read from the code only.
