C 39578 Do nothing (padding)
C 39579 Call #R$9AA3 (inside "Shared action 1: the police cab, GO TO...") - Is this one of the police cab's routes? No: refuse
C 39582 If the zero flag is set, jump on to the routine "Fail: A = 0, HL = 0, Z set" (#R$DC15)
C 39585 Jump on to #R$9AD7
C 39587 Read the current actor's room (#R$A00A) into A - From Old Mill Road (room 103)...
C 39590 Compare A with $67
C 39592 If A differs from $67, skip ahead to #R$9AB5
C 39594 Read #R$A032($A034) in "Game variables" into A - ...to Main Street (50): 112 minutes
C 39597 Compare A with $32
C 39599 Load L with $70
C 39601 If A equals $32, skip ahead to #R$9AC8
C 39603 Set A to zero, which sets the zero flag for the caller
C 39604 Return to the caller
C 39605 Compare A with $32 - From Main Street (50)...
C 39607 If A differs from $32, go back to #R$9AB3
C 39609 Read #R$A032($A034) in "Game variables" into A - ...to Old Mill Road (103): 114 minutes,
C 39612 Compare A with $67
C 39614 Load L with $72
C 39616 If A equals $67, skip ahead to #R$9AC8
C 39618 Compare A with $12 - or to Kings Cross Road (18): 94 minutes
C 39620 If A differs from $12, go back to #R$9AB3
C 39622 Load L with $5E
C 39624 Make A non-zero, which clears the zero flag, and hand that back to the caller - NZ: a route, L = its minutes
C 39626 Return to the caller
c 39627 Shared action 2: the police cab, GO FURIOUSLY TO - 20 minutes quicker
D 39627 Header $04 $00 then code: the same routes (#R$9AA3) with 20 minutes taken off - 94 out to Old Mill Road and 92 back. That matches Lestrade's own trips logged in the emulator (Main Street 1:39pm to Old Mill Road 3:13, and back 3:14 to 4:47). The local police man's action list (after its 00 entry) sends verb #R$9A99(29), GO TO, to shared action 1 and verb #R$9ACB(30), GO FURIOUSLY TO, here. Lestrade's orders use verb #R$9ACB(30) both ways in the chase, and SAY TO POLICE MAN "GO FURIOUSLY TO KINGS CROSS ROAD" took 75 minutes against 95 for plain GO TO (tools/experiments/chase.py stages F2 and P). CORRECTED: was data in the automatic split.
R 39627 Input:IX The action record
R 39627 Output:F Z when the route is refused; otherwise continues at $9B04
B 39627,2 Action record header: flags $04; byte 1 $00
