C 39636 Subtract $14 from A
C 39638 Copy A into L
C 39639 Load A with $6D - The thing named at #R$E2C6 is $6D (109)...
C 39641 Store A in "HAIL: the cab hailed, plus one" (#R$E2C6)
C 39644 Load A with $69 - ...and the shared-action code is $69; carry on as #R$9B04 does
C 39646 Skip ahead to #R$9B04
c 39649 Shared action 15: GO FURIOUSLY TO in a hansom cab - dearer, two minutes quicker
D 39649 Header $04 $00 then code: the route check (#R$9B50), the fare at 6d a step (#R$9B25 with DE = 6), and the table's minutes less 2 as the ride's length; then on as #R$9AF4. A cabbie's own action list sends verb #R$9AE1(30) (GO FURIOUSLY TO) here. Read from the code.
R 39649 Input:IX The action record (a cabbie's GO FURIOUSLY TO)
R 39649 Output:F From the ride routine at $9B02
B 39649,2 Action record header: flags $04; byte 1 $00
C 39651 (#R$9B50)
C 39654 Load DE with $0006 - DE = 6 (#R$9B25)
C 39657 Call the routine "Price a cab ride from its journey time" (#R$9B25)
C 39660 Read byte +2 of the record at IX into A - L = the byte at IX+2 minus 2
C 39663 Subtract $02 from A
C 39665 Copy A into L
C 39666 Join the common ending at #R$9B02
c 39668 Shared action 14: GO TO in a hansom cab
D 39668 Header $04 $00 then code (a cabbie's action list sends verb #R$9AF4(29), GO TO, here): the route check (#R$9B50), the fare at 2d a step (#R$9B25 with DE = 2) and the table's minutes as the ride's length (#R$9B02 stores it at #R$A01A($A01F)); then the cab is moved (#R$DD0E) and the ride handed to the vehicle sub-script #R$F3AD. Confirmed in the emulator: 20 minutes and 10d from Baker Street to Parliament Street (tools/experiments/cab_test.py).
R 39668 Input:IX The action record (a cabbie's GO TO)
R 39668 Output:HL $F3AD, the vehicle sub-script
R 39668 F Carry set
B 39668,2 Action record header: flags $04; byte 1 $00
C 39670 Can the cab get there from here? (#R$9B50)
C 39673 Load DE with $0002 - The fare at 2d a step (#R$9B25 with DE = 2)
C 39676 Call the routine "Price a cab ride from its journey time" (#R$9B25)
C 39679 Read byte +2 of the record at IX into L - L = the table's journey time, in minutes (IX+2)
C 39682 Load A with $01
C 39684 Save AF on the stack
