D 40098 Played, Wednesday morning: with the player waiting outside, the note is revealed at 10:05am, the countdown #R$9CA1 (15 at the start) falls once a minute and reaches 0 at 10:24am. A plain TAKE of the note runs the shared TAKE script at #R$DF7E, which sets the countdown to $FF (stopped) and renames the note SINGE, so it can be examined and used as evidence; TAKE NOTE FROM FIREPLACE does not run that script and the note still burns away.
