c 40734 Store A at HL, put the actor in room B, and its next turn DE minutes on
D 40734 The actor's own record (#R$A012($A017)) gets room B and no container; the actor-table entry at IY has its next-turn minute (+6/+7) moved on by DE. Used twice by the gardener's after-turn routine (#R$9ED1): at 9pm he is put off stage (room 0, his room remembered at #R$9ED0) with his next turn about 504 minutes later (plus a random number up to 30, added to the low byte only), and on that turn he is put back. Read from the code.
D 40734 Confirmed in the emulator (tools/experiments/phipps_route.py 8): the gardener left at 9:05pm each night and came back at 5:30am on Tuesday, but at 1:40am on Wednesday and 1:35am on Thursday - see the Bugs page.
R 40734 Input:A The value to store
R 40734 HL Where to store it
R 40734 B The room to put the actor in
R 40734 DE The minutes until its next turn
R 40734 IY The actor's entry in the actor table
R 40734 Output:IX The actor's own record ($A017)
