C 41152 Read byte +7 of the record at IY into D
C 41155 Add DE to HL
C 41156 Store L in byte +6 of the record at IY
C 41159 Store H in byte +7 of the record at IY
C 41162 Save IY on the stack - Its own after-turn routine, if any
C 41164 Call the routine "Run the current actor's own after-turn routine" (#R$9C77)
C 41167 Restore IY from the stack
C 41169 Load DE with $0008, the amount that is added next - Next actor (8 bytes on)
C 41172 Add DE to IY
C 41174 Go back to #R$A097
C 41176 Add one to C
C 41177 Set bits  of A (mask $00)
C 41179 Read byte +6 of the record at IY into E - Compare the minute counter (HL) with the actor's next-turn time
C 41182 Read byte +7 of the record at IY into D
C 41185 Copy H into A
C 41186 Compare A with D
C 41187 If A differs from D, return
C 41188 Copy L into A
C 41189 Compare A with E
C 41190 Return to the caller
