C 42207 Restore DE from the stack
C 42208 Save DE on the stack
C 42209 Save HL on the stack
C 42210 Save IY on the stack
C 42212 Call the routine "Does the word reference at HL match the one at IY? (Z)" (#R$A51B) - #R$A4E0: the first pair must match
