c 42267 Does the word reference at HL match the one at IY? (Z)
D 42267 An empty one (0) at HL matches anything. Otherwise compares the low byte and the low nibble of the high byte. HL and IY both move on two bytes. Read from the code.
R 42267 Input:HL A word reference of the command (0 matches anything)
R 42267 IY A word reference of the pattern
R 42267 Output:F Z when they match
R 42267 HL, IY Both moved on two bytes
