b 43100 Word suffixes
D 43100 Nine 4-byte entries, zero-padded, chosen by the low nibble of a dictionary word's flags ($F = no suffix; see dictionary.py). Code 8 is a delete, so suffix 3 turns SPY into SPIES and suffix 7 RIDE into RIDING. #R$A93A($A93B) indexes it.
