D 44283 2. In command mode, if #R$A01A($A01B) is set (a line of sentences is being worked through), just read on.
D 44283 3. Otherwise go back to the start of the sentence, whose position, flags, sentence count and node were saved by #R$ACCC, free the nodes that were made after it (#R$A1AF) and unhook them, ready to read the sentence again.
