D 44785 2. If IX has no words at +4 and +5 there is nothing more to do.
D 44785 3. If IY already has words at +14 to +23 stop. Otherwise move IY's first group up to the second group and copy IX's words from +4.
D 44785 4. Copy IX's second word in as well if IY has none.
