D 47391 CORRECTED 2026-11-07: this was titled 'setup-only', from a test that saw 25 hits during the intro and none during LOOK. Re-tested with breakpoints stepped over properly: LOOK 19 hits, WAIT 67, TAKE LAMP 18 - once per actor whose turn comes up, every turn. N ('YOU CANNOT GO NORTH.', which takes no time) 0. The id sequence the old test saw (0, 2-6, 104, 7-13, 31, 34, 36-43) is simply the actor table's order.
