c 47648 A remark for Watson or Inspector Lestrade: let them reply
D 47648 Reached from #R$B936 when the node waiting for the actor has +7 = 2 (made by #R$B8D1 when the player speaks to someone). For Watson (actor 3) the reply code is at #R$BA67, for Lestrade (2) at #R$BB67; #R$BA3E runs it on the player's words (IY = node +5/+6, through #R$D1DB), then frees the words (#R$A1AF) and the node (#R$B9FA). Other actors ignore remarks. The two reply routines are described at #R$BA67 and #R$BB67, and both were tried in the emulator.
