c 48198 Check every statement that is waiting to be proven
D 48198 Walks the case table (#R$9965) and, for each statement with bit 0 set and bit 5 clear, tries to prove it (#R$BCC9).
D 48198 How it works:
D 48198 1. Push every statement of the case table at #R$9965 that is waiting (bit 0 of +3 set) and is not one of the bit-5 kind, ending the list with a 0.
D 48198 2. Pop them one at a time and try to prove each (#R$BCC9).
R 48198 Output:Each waiting statement of the case table checked and, if provable, marked
C 48198 Point IX at "The case: statements about the crime, and the..." (#R$9965)
