C 48930 Save HL on the stack
C 48931 Restore IY from the stack
C 48933 Print them (#R$D3E8)
C 48936 The relation word, from the table at #R$994D (#R$BF45)
C 48939 Relation 0: print the word $005D instead
C 48941 Print the relation word (#R$A887)
C 48944 Read byte +2 of the record at IX into A - The statement's object (+2): its name words
C 48947 Call the routine "HL = thing A's record + 7" (#R$A4BC)
C 48950 Save HL on the stack
C 48951 Restore IY from the stack
C 48953 Call the routine "Print the name words at IY" (#R$D3E8)
C 48956 Return to the caller - Done
