t 48985 Day names, and the clock text being built
D 48985 Seven three-letter day names (Mon-Sun) for #R$BFC6, then #R$BF6E, the 11-character clock text ('MON 00:00am' as it stands in the file) that #R$BF79 fills in and prints.
