C 49174 Compare A with $0C - pm: 12 noon to 12:59 counts as morning (4)
C 49176 If A equals $0C, skip ahead to #R$C035
C 49178 Compare A with $08 - 8pm or later: night (1)
C 49180 If A is below $08, skip ahead to #R$C021
