C 49197 If A equals $0C, go back to #R$C01E
C 49199 Compare A with $06
C 49201 If A is below $06, go back to #R$C01E
C 49203 6am: dawn (5)
C 49205 Load A with $04 - 7am to 11am: morning (4)
C 49207 Return to the caller
C 49208 Load A with $05
C 49210 Return to the caller
