W 49417,2 Length (DE)
W 49419,2 Start (IX)
W 49421,2 Parameter 2
c 49423 Set the border, then clear the screen and attributes
D 49423 Sets the border to white, then fills the whole display file (6,144 bytes at #LINK(rom_symbols#a4000)($4000)) with zero and the whole attribute file (768 bytes at #LINK(rom_symbols#a5800)($5800)) with $38 (INK 0 / PAPER 7: black on white, no bright, no flash) - i.e. a standard CLS.
D 49423 Confirmed in the emulator: hooking every write to screen memory during boot shows exactly 6,144 writes at this routine's first LDIR and 767-768 at its second, matching the display and attribute file sizes exactly.
R 49423 Output:The screen cleared, the attributes black on white and the border white
