w 50289 Words for a +5 flag that should be set but is not
D 50289 Dictionary word references, one per bit of an object's +5 flags, printed by #R$CB7B after 'THE <object> IS'. 0 = no word. Together the two tables name the flags: bit 0 locked, bit 2 full, bit 4 on (lit), bit 5 open, bit 6 alive; bit 7 is 'revealed' (#R$9C56). Bits 5 and 7 are confirmed by play; the rest are read from these words.
