W 50291,2 Bit 1: none
W 50293,2 Bit 2: EMPTY
W 50295,2 Bit 3: none
W 50297,2 Bit 4: OFF
W 50299,2 Bit 5: CLOSED
W 50301,2 Bit 6: DEAD
W 50303,2 Bit 7: none
