C 50881 Keep only bits 0, 1, 2, 3 of A (mask $0F)
C 50883 If any of bits 0, 1, 2, 3 of A was set, skip ahead to #R$C6CB
C 50885 Make A non-zero, which clears the zero flag, and hand that back to the caller - Pass: NZ
C 50887 Return to the caller
C 50888 Refuse
C 50891 Compare A with $05 - Codes 5 and 6: a number
C 50893 If A is below $05, skip ahead to #R$C6F5
C 50895 Compare A with $07
C 50897 If A is $07 or more, jump on to #R$C719
