C 50904 If A differs from $FE, go back to #R$C654
C 50907 Read #R$A02A($A031) in "Game variables" into HL
C 50910 Read byte +1 of the record at IY into A - ...with bit 7 of its low byte clear for code 5...
C 50913 Keep only bits 0, 1, 2, 3 of A (mask $0F)
C 50915 Compare A with $05
C 50917 If A differs from $05, skip ahead to #R$C6EE
C 50919 Test bit 7 of L
C 50921 If bit 7 of L is clear, go back to #R$C6C5
C 50923 Go back to #R$C654
C 50926 Test bit 7 of L - ...and set for code 6
C 50928 If bit 7 of L is set, go back to #R$C6C5
C 50930 Go back to #R$C654
