C 50935 If A is $03 or more, skip ahead to #R$C706
C 50937 Read #R$A032($A035) in "Game variables" into A
C 50940 Call the routine "Find a room record" (#R$D224)
C 50943 Test bit 7 of the first byte of the record at IX
C 50947 If bit 7 of the first byte of the record at IX is clear, go back to #R$C654
C 50950 Test bit 0 of byte +1 of the record at IY - Codes 1 and 3: and next door to the actor (#R$D471)
C 50954 If bit 0 of byte +1 of the record at IY is clear, go back to #R$C6C5
C 50956 Read #R$A032($A035) in "Game variables" into A
C 50959 Call #R$D471 (inside "Find the exit from the actor's room through...")
C 50962 Compare A with $FF
C 50964 If A equals $FF, go back to #R$C654
C 50967 Go back to #R$C6C5
