C 51235 Save BC on the stack
C 51236 Call the routine "Resolve an id (in A) to its full entity record" (#R$D237) - IX = the thing's record; B = the thing
C 51239 Copy A into B
C 51240 Read #R$A032($A036) in "Game variables" into A - A = what the actor is in or held by, at the top (#R$C863)
C 51243 Call the routine "Is thing number A here? (#R$C86E)" (#R$C863)
C 51246 Compare A with B - The thing itself: yes
C 51247 If A equals B, jump on to #R$C85D
C 51249 Test bit 7 of the flags byte (+5) of the thing record at IX (revealed) - +5 bit 7 clear: no
C 51253 If bit 7 of the flags byte (+5) of the thing record at IX is clear, skip ahead to #R$C85A
C 51255 Copy A into C - B = the actor's top; A = the thing's own top
C 51256 Copy B into A
C 51257 Copy C into B
C 51258 Call the routine "Is thing number A here? (#R$C86E)" (#R$C863)
C 51261 Copy A into C
C 51262 Read #R$A032($A036) in "Game variables" into A - Held by the actor: yes
C 51265 Compare A with C
C 51266 If A equals C, skip ahead to #R$C85D
C 51268 Copy C into A - Different tops: no
C 51269 Compare A with B
C 51270 If A differs from B, skip ahead to #R$C85A
C 51272 Add one to A - The same holder (not $FF): yes
C 51273 If A is not zero, skip ahead to #R$C85D
C 51275 Read the number byte (+0) of the thing record at IX into B - Neither held: is the actor's room one of the thing's rooms?
C 51278 Read the current actor's room (#R$A00A) into A
C 51281 Compare A with the rooms byte (+15) of the thing record at IX
C 51284 If A equals the rooms byte (+15) of the thing record at IX, skip ahead to #R$C85D
C 51286 Step IX on to the next byte
C 51288 Count B down and, while it is not zero, go back to #R$C851
C 51290 Clear A to zero (and the carry flag) - Z: no
C 51291 Skip ahead to #R$C85F
C 51293 Set bit 0 of A - NZ: yes
C 51295 Restore BC from the stack
C 51296 Restore IX from the stack
C 51298 Return to the caller
