C 51518 Does the actor list this verb itself?
C 51521 If the carry flag is clear, skip ahead to #R$C94D
C 51523 Look the verb up in the shared actions table (#R$D349)
C 51526 Call the routine "Search a table of two-byte entries for A" (#R$D349)
C 51529 $FF = no shared action
C 51531 Yes: use the shared action it names
C 51533 Not yet explained (#R$A00A($A00F) < 7: skip the object check)
C 51536 Compare A with $07
C 51538 If A is below $07, skip ahead to #R$C972
C 51540 IX = the direct object's own record
C 51544 Does the object list this verb?
C 51547 Call the routine "Does this object list verb A in its own action list?" (#R$D1DC)
C 51550 No: use the verb's default action
C 51552 Yes: the entry's second byte is a shared-action index
