C 51556 Load D with $00
C 51558 The table's base
C 51561 Step DE back one byte
C 51562 (number-1) * 2, added twice for a word-sized stride
C 51563 Add DE to HL
C 51564 This entry's own table value...
C 51565 Step HL on to the next byte
C 51566 ...becomes the result
C 51567 Swap DE and HL
C 51573 Point IX at "Each verb's default action record" (#R$9F38)
C 51577 Call the routine "Find a 3-byte record by id, in a sentinel-terminated..." (#R$D34E)
C 51588 Read byte +2 of the record at IX into H
