C 51613 Restore IY from the stack
C 51615 Carry: it is a script record
C 51617 Z: failed - end the actor's go (#R$CB43)
C 51620 Make A non-zero, which clears the zero flag, and hand that back to the caller - NZ: done
C 51622 Return to the caller
C 51623 Save HL on the stack - Script record: save the actor's current script as a sub-script frame (#R$CF80)...
C 51624 Save BC on the stack
