C 51628 Load B with $01
C 51630 Call the routine "Save a sub-script call frame" (#R$CF80)
C 51633 Restore BC from the stack
C 51634 Restore HL from the stack
C 51635 Read the current actor's (#R$9FDB) into IX - ...and set the actor's script to the new one (HL, in +1/+2 of its record)
C 51639 Store L in byte +1 of the record at IX
C 51642 Store H in byte +2 of the record at IX
C 51645 Set the carry flag for the caller - Carry: a script was started
C 51646 Return to the caller
C 51647 Header checks: bit 5 of the record's byte 0 and #R$D078 (dark)...
C 51662 ...refuse with the message at #R$CBBB when it is too dark for that action
C 51667 The object-requirement checks (#R$C628, #R$C6BE)
