C 53746 If the first byte of the record at IX has become zero, skip ahead to #R$D201
C 53748 ...or the $00 terminator?
C 53751 If the first byte of the record at IX has become zero, skip ahead to #R$D204
C 53753 Neither: next pair
C 53755 Step IX on to the next byte
C 53757 Go back to #R$D1EA
C 53759 Found: carry set, IX on the pair
C 53760 Return to the caller
C 53761 Put the $FF back
C 53764 Not listed: carry clear
C 53765 Return to the caller
