D 54421 Confirmed empirically, not just by reading the code: called this directly with A=0 while the player was in the sitting room and got $08 back; moved the player north into the small closet in the real game and called it again - got $09; moved back south - got $08 again. This is genuinely 'what room is this actor in', not a guess from the byte offset alone.
