b 55447 The line editor's inside-quotes flag
D 55447 1 outside quotation marks, 0 inside: set to 1 at the start of each line (#R$D8BE) and flipped by each quote mark typed or rubbed out (#R$D8F6, #R$D908). At ENTER an open quotation is closed for you (#R$D949). CORRECTED: was taken for a NOP at the head of #R$D898.
