C 56639 Keep only bits 3, 5 of A (mask $28)
C 56641 Read the size byte (+2) of the thing record at IX into A - Its size
C 56644 Restore IX from the stack
C 56646 Not open: refuse
C 56648 At least the actor's size?
C 56651 Too small: refuse
C 56653 Set A to zero, which sets the zero flag for the caller - Pass (Z)
C 56654 Return to the caller
C 56655 Make A non-zero, which clears the zero flag, and hand that back to the caller - Refuse (NZ)
C 56657 Return to the caller
