c 59362 Script helper: is the actor carrying this?
D 59362 A record with no code to speak of (OR 1 / RET): all the work is the requirement code 10 in its header - the direct object must be here and held by the actor - so RUN #R$E7E2 / thing simply fails unless the actor has the thing (Watson and his newspaper, Lestrade and the large rock). Read from the code; requirement 10 itself is confirmed by play (see #R$C628).
