C 61892 Store E in byte +9 of the record at IX - Its state word (+9/+10) = DE
C 61895 Store D in byte +10 of the record at IX
C 61898 Read byte +8 of the record at IX into A - +8: keep the low nibble, replace the high nibble with B
C 61901 Keep only bits 0, 1, 2, 3 of A (mask $0F)
C 61903 Set in A the bits that are set in B
C 61904 Store A in byte +8 of the record at IX
C 61907 Make A non-zero, which clears the zero flag, and hand that back to the caller - Succeed
